        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Leo — 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p>You are in more places than one, briefly, and each of them is punching.</p><p>Make three unarmed Strikes against any creatures within 30 feet at no increase to your multiple attack penalty. Target whoever you mean to hit before you cast; the Strikes are dealt out among them in turn, so one enemy takes all three.</p><p>The activity counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty afterward — pf2e does not count a turn's attacks, so that last clause is yours to honour.</p><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 17th level, add one Strike.</p><p><em>On a day your constellation is Ascendant this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a Zenith, 8 levels higher.</em></p>"
